Match List I (Molecular speed / propagation speed in an ideal gas of molecular mass $m$ and absolute temperature $T$) with List II (Mathematical expression):

\begin{array}{ll}
\textbf{List I} & \textbf{List II} \\
\text{A. Most probable speed } (v_{mp}) & \text{I. } \sqrt{\frac{3 k_B T}{m}} \\
\text{B. Average speed } (\bar{v}) & \text{II. } \sqrt{\frac{8 k_B T}{\pi m}} \\
\text{C. Root-mean-square speed } (v_{rms}) & \text{III. } \sqrt{\frac{\gamma k_B T}{m}} \\
\text{D. Speed of sound } (v_s) & \text{IV. } \sqrt{\frac{2 k_B T}{m}}
\end{array}

